l\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">These would be easy although I don't they they fleshed out the Daeva Corperation enough to be on par to the stuff that has been put into Hunter Conspiracies. I imagine that <b>Mortal Remains</b> will include that.</div> </div> </div> </div>We already know that the Deva Corporation (&quot;Daeva&quot; is Persian and refers to demons, &quot;Deva&quot; is Indian and refers to gods) is NOT the Demon-focused Conspiracy in the Mortal Remains.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-17T12:37:37-08:00","id":51783,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/47344-hunters-hunting-demons-and-angels?p=47579#post47579\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There is also a Compact in the book, but we don't know anything about it yet as far as I know.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm expecting the compact to partake more of Inferno demons than Descent demons (though really, they have different enough tones and implications that I'd support treating them as being as separate as either is from fae).<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/321-sunlessnick","name":"SunlessNick","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1214"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}